{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1061","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Coins"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have unlimited number of coins with values $$$1, 2, \\ldots, n$$$. You want to select some set of coins having the total value of $$$S$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is allowed to have multiple coins with the same value in the set. What is the minimum number of coins required to get sum $$$S$$$?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of the input contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$S$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 100\\,000$$$, $$$1 \\le S \\le 10^9$$$)"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print exactly one integer — the minimum number of coins required to obtain sum $$$S$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 11\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6 16\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, some of the possible ways to get sum $$$11$$$ with $$$3$$$ coins are: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(3, 4, 4)$$$"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(2, 4, 5)$$$"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(1, 5, 5)$$$"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(3, 3, 5)$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is impossible to get sum $$$11$$$ with less than $$$3$$$ coins."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, some of the possible ways to get sum $$$16$$$ with $$$3$$$ coins are: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(5, 5, 6)$$$"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(4, 6, 6)$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is impossible to get sum $$$16$$$ with less than $$$3$$$ coins."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"